## 4. Comparison Pages Plan & SEO

### 7 Comparison Pages

Each comparison page lives at `/vs/[competitor]` and follows a consistent structure.

#### Page Structure (all 7 pages):
1. Hero with H1 headline + positioning tagline
2. Quick comparison table (features + pricing side-by-side)
3. "What [Competitor] does well" (genuine, builds credibility)
4. "Where [Competitor] falls short for celebration" (specific gaps)
5. "How CelebBoard is different" (feature walkthrough)
6. Pricing comparison (always favorable for CelebBoard)
7. "Who should choose [Competitor]" (fair — builds trust)
8. "Who should choose CelebBoard" (the celebration buyer)
9. FAQ section (4-6 comparison-specific questions)
10. CTA: "Try CelebBoard free for 14 days"

