featuredImageAlt: "Descriptive alt text with keyword where natural"
---
```

### On-Page SEO Checklist (for every article):

- [ ] H1 = article `title` (only one H1)
- [ ] H2s contain secondary/supporting keywords
- [ ] H3s used for subsections under H2s — never skip heading levels
- [ ] Primary keyword appears in: title, first 100 words, one H2, meta description, URL slug
- [ ] Internal links: minimum 2 links to other blog articles + 1 link to /features or /pricing
- [ ] External links: 1-2 links to reputable sources where relevant (research, data)
- [ ] Image alt text is descriptive and includes keywords where natural
- [ ] Article length matches spec (never thin content under 1,500 words)
- [ ] CTA at the end: links to /pricing or "Start free trial"
- [ ] `hreflang` alternates set in metadata (EN ↔ FR)
- [ ] Article schema via JSON-LD in the page component

